<title>USA: RockShox Inc IPO terms set.</title>
<headline>RockShox Inc IPO terms set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>RockShox Inc plans to offer 4.8 million shares at an estimated price range of $13 to $15 per share in its upcoming initial public offering, according to a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The offering, lead-managed by Merrill Lynch, is tentatively set for the week of September 23.  The proposed stock symbol on the Nasdaq is &quot;RSHX&quot;.</p>
<p>The company designs, manufactures and markets bicycle suspension products.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
